The PR412 ZigBee Curtain Control provides remote open/close control for curtains and blinds, extending the range and strengthening ZigBee network communication.

## Key Features

- ZigBee HA 1.2 compliant
- Remote open/close control
- Extends the range and strengthens ZigBee network communication
- 6A load rating (220VAC / 110VAC)
- Compact size: 64 x 45 x 15mm, 77g
